From: ksooo <kai.sommerfeld@gmx.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 15:19:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [VideoPlayer] Audio ID3: Update the displayed artist with
 each tag

The artist description, which the GUI shows, was only filled by the
first ID3v2 tag of a stream. Later tags changed the artist list only,
so a live stream kept showing the artist of its first item.
---
 xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/VideoPlayerAudioID3.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/VideoPlayerAudioID3.cpp b/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/VideoPlayerAudioID3.cpp
index 44ea1f3..132d3a1 100644
--- a/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/VideoPlayerAudioID3.cpp
+++ b/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/VideoPlayerAudioID3.cpp
@@ -263,7 +263,7 @@ void CVideoPlayerAudioID3::ProcessID3v2(const ID3v2::Tag* tag) const
 
           else if (it.first == "TPE1")
           {
-            currentMusic->SetArtist(GetID3v2StringList(it.second));
+            currentMusic->SetArtist(GetID3v2StringList(it.second), true);
             changed = true;
           }
 
